  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 0.9.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* and_rebase: use workdir() rather than .path().parent() by @Pear0 in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/191\n* Extract structs that encode announcements to users by @blairconrad in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/194\n* Add flag to create squash commits by @blairconrad in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/195\n* Make output more human-readable by @blairconrad in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/200\n* ci: add darwin arm64 (aarch64-apple-darwin) build target by @radiosilence in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/203\n* Add --no-limit option by @p1k0chu in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/204\n* Refrain from compiling debug-level messages out of release build by @blairconrad in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/208\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Pear0 made their first contribution in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/191\n* @radiosilence made their first contribution in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/203\n* @p1k0chu made their first contribution in https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/pull/204\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tummychow/git-absorb/compare/0.8.0...0.9.0",
